    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #377\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nWorking tree was already clean (nothing new to commit). Pushed the new commit to the existing branch `bb/relay-239-generic-rest-02-09-mount-named-custom-thr_gzk8zqd7kz`, which already has PR #377 open.\n\nThis push addresses both medium-severity findings from the PR #377 code review:\n- Added `docs/adr/2026-09-11-module-manifest-custom-routes.md` documenting the custom-route-manifest architectural decision.\n- Removed the unused `ModuleRegistry.getCustomRoutes()` / `ModuleCustomRouteProjection` (scope creep — `semprec-api` only ever used `getCustomRouteDefinitions()`).\n\nFull `pnpm run verify` passed (197 unit tests, 937 integration tests, 5 e2e tests, all green) before pushing.\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
